                                        <h3>How much does LMS development cost?</h3>
                                        <p>MVP: ₹25-60 lakh ($30K-72K). Growth: ₹75 lakh - 1.8 Cr ($90K-215K). Enterprise: ₹2-5 Cr ($240K-600K).</p>
                                        <h3>Should I use Moodle or build custom?</h3>
                                        <p>Moodle for higher-ed with standard needs. Custom for corporate + consumer ed-tech where UX matters more.</p>
                                        <h3>Is video streaming really that expensive?</h3>
